OL,3,GNEWSAHomeless charity takes over six
OL,4,Amodular homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FSix modular homes that were destined
OL,7,Ffor landfill have been taken on as
OL,8,Faccommodation by a homeless charity.
OL,10,FCambridge Cyrenians said four of the
OL,11,Fhomes, which are at Christ the Redeemer
OL,12,FChurch, were already occupied.
OL,14,FJames Martin, the charity's director,
OL,15,Fsaid the accommodation would "really
OL,16,Fmake a difference" by giving residents
OL,17,Ftheir own space and supporting them in
OL,18,Ftaking their "final step into
OL,19,Findependence".
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
